./scheds/README.md:28:schedulers are now found only in the Linux kernel repository in
./scheds/README.md:29:[`tools/sched_ext`](https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/torvalds/linux.git/tree/tools/sched_ext).
./scheds/README.md:30:Each C scheduler's purpose was to demonstrate a single technique for development,
