docs/missions/lavd-scope-audit.log:1463:docs/missions/lavd-scope-audit.log:742:scheds/rust/scx_pandemonium/README.md:47:Both modes beat EEVDF and scx_bpfland by a wide margin. Burst-storm cost is workload-sensitive across iterations.
